      "detailed_description": "Sorry, this game is not yet translated into English.<br>If you would like to play the English version, please add it to your wishlist and wait.<br>We will let you know when it is translated!<br><br>----<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world of inadvertent lewd language adventures! </h2>It often happens that lewd words are inadvertently made up in conversation, doesn't it?<br>This game is probably the world's first adventure game where you will find such &quot;inadvertent lewd words&quot; to advance the game!<br><br><strong>Game Introduction</strong>.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>High-speed lewd word action</strong>.<br>Find the lewd words quickly from the nonstop stream of words on the screen!<br>Your score is determined by the number, speed and accuracy of the words you find.<br>This is a unique game system that offers thrilling action.<br><br></li><li><strong>It doesn't end with just a silly game. A surprising and moving multi-end story! </strong><br>The story begins when you join the Public Discipline Committee.<br>You will be the newest member of the Public Discipline Committee, and you will be in charge of controlling the &quot;careless and lewd language&quot; that infests the school and its surroundings.<br>What's the point of doing that?<br><br>And this game has multiple endings.<br>Why does such a stupid game have multiple endings?　You may be wondering why such a silly game has multiple endings.<br>Depending on your actions, your future will change in various ways.<br>I wish you the best ending.</li></ul>",
